<title>NIGERIA: Shell says 13 more Nigerian detainees freed.</title>
<headline>Shell says 13 more Nigerian detainees freed.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell said on Tuesday that 13 more of its 109 staff and contractors held in Nigeria by feuding communities had been freed.</p>
<p>&quot;It is good news and we are getting somewhere but 96 others are still detained by villagers from the two communities,&quot; a Shell spokesman told Reuters in Lagos.</p>
</text>
